{"title": "Kwiżż tal-Ġilda | Ibni l-Pjan Personali Tiegħek tas-Serum | Tava Labs", "description": "Wieġeb ftit mistoqsijiet malajr u ibni l-pjan personali tiegħek madwar il-PDRN Brightening Serum. Serum wieħed, darbtejn kuljum, imqabbel mal-ġilda tiegħek u mal-miri tiegħek.", "contentHtml": "\n\n<div class=\"wrap\">\n  <header class=\"top\">\n    <div class=\"wordmark\">TAVA<small>LABS</small></div>\n    <span style=\"font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);\">PDRN Brightening Serum</span>\n  </header>\n\n  <div class=\"progress-zone\" id=\"progressZone\" hidden>\n    <div class=\"progress-meta\">\n      <button class=\"backbtn\" id=\"backBtn\" type=\"button\">&larr; Lura</button>\n      <span id=\"stepLabel\"></span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"bar\"><div id=\"barFill\"></div></div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- 1 · HOOK -->\n  <section class=\"screen\" data-screen=\"hook\" data-progress=\"6\" data-step-label=\"6 mistoqsijiet għall-pjan tiegħek\">\n    <img class=\"bottle\" src=\"§IMG0§\" alt=\"Flixkun tal-PDRN Brightening Serum ta’ Tava Labs\">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\">Ibni l-pjan tiegħek ta’ manutenzjoni tal-fundatur</p>\n    <h1>Serum wieħed. Darbtejn kuljum. <em>30 jum.</em></h1>\n    <p class=\"lede\">Il-laqgħa li jmiss tiegħek tibda minnek. Wieġeb ftit mistoqsijiet malajr u aħna nibnu l-pjan personali tiegħek ta’ 30 jum madwar il-PDRN Brightening Serum, pass wieħed filgħodu bħala tħejjija għall-jum u pass wieħed billejl biex tagħlqu. Abbonament, u tista’ twaqqfu temporanjament jew tikkanċellah fi kwalunkwe ħin.</p>\n    <button class=\"cta\" type=\"button\" data-next>Ibni l-pjan tiegħi</button>\n    <p class=\"note\">PDRN Brightening Serum · 1 fl oz (30 ml) · Magħmul għal użu darbtejn kuljum</p>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 2 · Q1 GOAL -->\n  <section class=\"screen\" data-screen=\"goal\" data-progress=\"14\" data-step-label=\"6 fadal\">\n    <h2>X’tixtieq l-aktar mit-30 jum li ġejjin?</h2>\n    <div class=\"choices\" data-choice-group=\"goal\">\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"radiance\"><span class=\"t\">Tiddi &amp; radjanza</span></button>\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"fine_lines\"><span class=\"t\">Linji fini</span></button>\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"hydration\"><span class=\"t\">Idratazzjoni profonda</span></button>\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"even_tone\"><span class=\"t\">Ton uniformi</span></button>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 3 · INTERSTITIAL 1 -->\n  <section class=\"screen\" data-screen=\"notalone\" data-progress=\"24\">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\">M’intix waħdek</p>\n    <h2 id=\"naTitle\">M’intix waħdek.</h2>\n    <p class=\"lede\" id=\"naBody\"></p>\n    <button class=\"cta\" type=\"button\" data-next>Kompli</button>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 4 · Q2 SKIN TYPE -->\n  <section class=\"screen\" data-screen=\"skinType\" data-progress=\"34\" data-step-label=\"5 fadal\">\n    <h2>Kif tħoss il-ġilda tiegħek normalment sa nofsinhar?</h2>\n    <div class=\"choices\" data-choice-group=\"skinType\">\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"dry\"><span class=\"t\">Xotta</span></button>\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"oily\"><span class=\"t\">Żejtnija</span></button>\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"combination\"><span class=\"t\">Kombinazzjoni</span></button>\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"sensitive\"><span class=\"t\">Sensittiva</span></button>\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"not_sure\"><span class=\"t\">Mhux ċert</span></button>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 5 · Q3 CONCERN -->\n  <section class=\"screen\" data-screen=\"concern\" data-progress=\"46\" data-step-label=\"4 fadal\">\n    <h2>U x’inhu t-tħassib ewlieni tiegħek bħalissa?</h2>\n    <div class=\"choices\" data-choice-group=\"concern\">\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"dullness\"><span class=\"t\">Nuqqas ta’ tiddi</span></button>\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"fine_lines\"><span class=\"t\">Linji fini</span></button>\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"uneven_tone\"><span class=\"t\">Ton mhux uniformi</span></button>\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"texture\"><span class=\"t\">Tessut aħrax</span></button>\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"dryness\"><span class=\"t\">Nxufija</span></button>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 6 · INTERSTITIAL 2 · FORMULA MATCH -->\n  <section class=\"screen\" data-screen=\"match\" data-progress=\"56\">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\">It-tqabbil tal-formula tiegħek</p>\n    <h2>Ġewwa l-flixkun, imqabbel mat-tweġibiet tiegħek</h2>\n    <p class=\"lede\" style=\"margin-bottom:2px;\">Formula waħda fissa — hawn x’fiha jitkellem ma’ dak li għadek kif għedt lilna.</p>\n    <div class=\"cardbox\" id=\"matchBox\"></div>\n    <button class=\"cta\" type=\"button\" data-next>Kompli</button>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 7 · Q4 SENSITIVITY -->\n  <section class=\"screen\" data-screen=\"sensitivity\" data-progress=\"64\" data-step-label=\"3 fadal\">\n    <h2>Il-ġilda tiegħek qatt irreaġixxiet għal prodotti qawwija qabel?</h2>\n    <div class=\"choices\" data-choice-group=\"sensitivity\">\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"often\"><span class=\"t\">Iva, faċilment</span></button>\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"sometimes\"><span class=\"t\">Xi drabi</span></button>\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"never\"><span class=\"t\">Rarament</span></button>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 8 · Q5 ROUTINE -->\n  <section class=\"screen\" data-screen=\"routine\" data-progress=\"74\" data-step-label=\"2 fadal\">\n    <h2>Kif tidher ir-rutina tiegħek illum?</h2>\n    <div class=\"choices\" data-choice-group=\"routine\">\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"cleanser_only\"><span class=\"t\">Tindif biss</span></button>\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"few_products\"><span class=\"t\">Ftit prodotti</span></button>\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"full_routine\"><span class=\"t\">Rutina sħiħa</span></button>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 9 · Q6 ROUTINE TIMES -->\n  <section class=\"screen\" data-screen=\"times\" data-progress=\"84\" data-step-label=\"L-aħħar mistoqsija\">\n    <h2>Meta se tapplikah?</h2>\n    <label class=\"f\">Filgħodu</label>\n    <div class=\"chips\" data-time-chips=\"amTime\">\n      <button class=\"chip\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"06:30\">6:30 AM</button>\n      <button class=\"chip\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"07:30\">7:30 AM</button>\n      <button class=\"chip\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"08:30\">8:30 AM</button>\n    </div>\n    <input type=\"time\" id=\"amCustom\" aria-label=\"Ħin personalizzat ta’ filgħodu\" style=\"margin-top:10px;\">\n    <label class=\"f\">Filgħaxija</label>\n    <div class=\"chips\" data-time-chips=\"pmTime\">\n      <button class=\"chip\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"21:00\">9:00 PM</button>\n      <button class=\"chip\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"22:00\">10:00 PM</button>\n      <button class=\"chip\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"22:30\">10:30 PM</button>\n    </div>\n    <input type=\"time\" id=\"pmCustom\" aria-label=\"Ħin personalizzat ta’ filgħaxija\" style=\"margin-top:10px;\">\n    <div style=\"height:22px\"></div>\n    <button class=\"cta\" type=\"button\" data-next>Kompli</button>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 10 · EMAIL -->\n  <section class=\"screen\" data-screen=\"email\" data-progress=\"92\" data-step-label=\"Kważi wasalt\">\n    <h2>Fejn għandna nibagħtu l-pjan tiegħek ta’ 30 jum?</h2>\n    <p class=\"lede\">Il-pjan tiegħek imur fl-inbox tiegħek. Uża din l-istess email meta tniżżel l-app — huwa kif l-app se tagħraf lilek, u t-tweġibiet, il-pjan, u l-ordni tiegħek se jkunu qed jistennewk hemm.</p>\n    <label class=\"f\" for=\"emailInput\">Indirizz tal-email</label>\n    <input type=\"email\" id=\"emailInput\" autocomplete=\"email\" placeholder=\"you@example.com\">\n    <div class=\"banner err\" id=\"emailErr\">Dik l-email ma tidhirx kompluta — iċċekkjaha u erġa’ pprova.</div>\n    <div style=\"height:18px\"></div>\n    <button class=\"cta\" type=\"button\" id=\"emailNext\">Uri l-pjan tiegħi</button>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 11 · PLAN REVEAL — treatment preview -->\n  <section class=\"screen\" data-screen=\"plan\" data-progress=\"97\" data-step-label=\"Il-pjan tiegħek\">\n    <div class=\"planhero\">\n      <p class=\"plan-eyebrow\">Il-previżjoni tat-trattament tiegħek</p>\n      <p class=\"plan-brand\">Tava Labs</p>\n      <h2 id=\"planTitle\">PDRN Brightening Serum</h2>\n      <div class=\"plan-bottle\"><img src=\"/assets/products/pdrn-bright-serum/view-1-mockup.jpg\" alt=\"Flixkun tal-PDRN Brightening Serum\"></div>\n      <p class=\"basedon\">Magħżul abbażi tal-miri tiegħek:</p>\n      <div class=\"goalchips\" id=\"goalChips\"></div>\n      <p class=\"priceline\">Pjanijiet li jibdew minn <strong>$39/month*</strong></p>\n      <p class=\"fineprint\">*Imħallas kull xahar. Waqqaf temporanjament jew ikkanċella fi kwalunkwe ħin.<br>Flixkun ta’ darba $49.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"cardbox\" style=\"margin-top:14px\">\n        <p style=\"font-family:Kanit,sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:2.5px;color:#B78B45;margin:0 0 8px\">L-EWWEL ĠIMGĦA TIEGĦEK</p>\n        <p style=\"margin:0 0 14px\">It-tweġibiet tiegħek diġà mmappjaw l-ewwel ġimgħa tiegħek tar-rutina. Ħamest ijiem fadal wara l-ewwel jumejn, u l-ewwel jum jibda fil-mument li s-serum tiegħek jintbagħat.</p>\n        <div style=\"display:flex;gap:8px\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n          <span style=\"flex:1;text-align:center;padding:9px 0;border-radius:10px;background:#123B2C;color:#D8C19A;font-family:Kanit,sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:13px\">Jum 1</span>\n          <span style=\"flex:1;text-align:center;padding:9px 0;border-radius:10px;background:#123B2C;color:#D8C19A;font-family:Kanit,sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:13px\">Jum 2</span>\n          <span style=\"flex:1;text-align:center;padding:9px 0;border-radius:10px;border:1.5px solid rgba(18,16,12,.25);font-family:Kanit,sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:13px\">Jum 3</span>\n          <span style=\"flex:1;text-align:center;padding:9px 0;border-radius:10px;border:1.5px solid rgba(18,16,12,.25);font-family:Kanit,sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:13px\">Jum 4</span>\n          <span style=\"flex:1;text-align:center;padding:9px 0;border-radius:10px;border:1.5px solid rgba(18,16,12,.25);font-family:Kanit,sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:13px\">Jum 5</span>\n          <span style=\"flex:1;text-align:center;padding:9px 0;border-radius:10px;border:1.5px solid rgba(18,16,12,.25);font-family:Kanit,sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:13px\">Jum 6</span>\n          <span style=\"flex:1;text-align:center;padding:9px 0;border-radius:10px;border:1.5px solid rgba(18,16,12,.25);font-family:Kanit,sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:13px\">Jum 7</span>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"cardbox detailscard\">\n      <h3>Dettalji tas-serum</h3>\n      <p>Serum wieħed. Darbtejn kuljum. 30 jum.</p>\n      <div class=\"stats\">\n        <div class=\"stat\"><span class=\"sk\">Tip</span><span class=\"sv\">Serum li jdawwal · 1 fl oz</span></div>\n        <div class=\"stat\"><span class=\"sk\">Użu</span><span class=\"sv\">Darbtejn kuljum</span></div>\n        <div class=\"stat\"><span class=\"sk\">Pjan</span><span class=\"sv\">30 jum</span></div>\n      </div>\n      <div id=\"planBox\"></div>\n      <details class=\"acc\" open>\n        <summary>Ingredjenti attivi</summary>\n        <div class=\"ingcards\" role=\"list\" aria-label=\"Ingredjenti attivi\">\n          <div class=\"ingcard\" role=\"listitem\"><span class=\"name\">PDRN</span><span class=\"sub\">Polydeoxyribonucleotide</span><img class=\"ingimg\" src=\"/assets/ingredients/ingredient-pdrn.png\" alt=\"Tessut tas-serum PDRN\" loading=\"lazy\"><p class=\"benefit\">Għal ġilda li tidher luminuża u radjanti</p></div>\n          <div class=\"ingcard\" role=\"listitem\"><span class=\"name\">Acetyl Hexapeptide-8</span><span class=\"sub\">Peptide</span><img class=\"ingimg\" src=\"/assets/ingredients/ingredient-peptide.png\" alt=\"Tessut tas-serum Acetyl Hexapeptide-8\" loading=\"lazy\"><p class=\"benefit\">Għal ġilda li tidher aktar lixxa</p></div>\n          <div class=\"ingcard\" role=\"listitem\"><span class=\"name\">Sodium Hyaluronate</span><span class=\"sub\">Aċidu ijaluroniku</span><img class=\"ingimg\" src=\"/assets/ingredients/ingredient-ha.png\" alt=\"Tessut tas-serum Sodium Hyaluronate\" loading=\"lazy\"><p class=\"benefit\">Għal idratazzjoni profonda u mimlija</p></div>\n          <div class=\"ingcard\" role=\"listitem\"><span class=\"name\">Panthenol</span><span class=\"sub\">Pro-vitamina B5</span><div class=\"ingtex\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><p class=\"benefit\">Għal ġilda ratba u komda</p></div>\n        </div>\n        <p class=\"ingnote\">Serum kosmetiku għal użu topiku. Għal użu estern biss. Evita l-għajnejn. Waqqaf jekk isseħħ irritazzjoni.</p>\n      </details>\n      <details class=\"acc\">\n        <summary>Kif tużah</summary>\n        <p>Applika 2 sa 4 pompi fuq ġilda nadifa u xotta, darbtejn kuljum. Kompli bi moisturizer jew sunscreen filgħodu.</p>\n      </details>\n      <details class=\"acc\">\n        <summary>Tajjeb li tkun taf</summary>\n        <p>Għal użu estern biss. Evita l-għajnejn. Waqqaf jekk isseħħ irritazzjoni. Żomm fejn ma jintlaħaqx mit-tfal. Tużax fuq ġilda maqsuma. Aħżen f’post frisk u xott.</p>\n      </details>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"featureband\">\n      <h3>Iltaqa’ mas-<em>serum tiegħek</em></h3>\n      <div class=\"feature\">\n        <img src=\"/assets/products/pdrn-bright-serum/view-1-mockup.jpg\" alt=\"Flixkun tal-PDRN Brightening Serum\">\n        <span class=\"callout c1\">Preżentazzjoni u radjanza</span>\n        <span class=\"callout c2\">Idratazzjoni profonda</span>\n        <span class=\"callout c3\">Linji fini</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <h3 class=\"featuretitle\">Riżultati reali</h3>\n    <div class=\"results\">\n      <figure class=\"resultcard\"><div class=\"resultimg\"><img src=\"/assets/before-after/D0DBB2D8-601B-46E8-BE29-A068C5DAF345.jpeg\" alt=\"Qabel u wara bil-PDRN Brightening Serum\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><span>Qabel</span><span>Wara</span></figcaption></figure>\n      <figure class=\"resultcard\"><div class=\"resultimg\"><img src=\"/assets/before-after/IMG_3056.jpeg\" alt=\"Qabel u wara bil-PDRN Brightening Serum\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><span>Qabel</span><span>Wara</span></figcaption></figure>\n      <figure class=\"resultcard\"><div class=\"resultimg\"><img src=\"/assets/before-after/IMG_3057.jpeg\" alt=\"Qabel u wara bil-PDRN Brightening Serum\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><figcaption><span>Qabel</span><span>Wara</span></figcaption></figure>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"resultsnote\">Ir-riżultati individwali jvarjaw.</p>\n    <div class=\"stickybar\">\n      <button class=\"cta\" type=\"button\" data-next>Kompli b’dan il-pjan</button>\n      <button class=\"altlink\" type=\"button\" data-next>Ara għażliet oħra</button>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 12 · OFFER + CHECKOUT -->\n  <section class=\"screen\" data-screen=\"checkout\" data-progress=\"99\" data-step-label=\"Ħlas\">\n    <h2>Ibda t-30 jum tiegħek</h2>\n    <div class=\"banner demo\" id=\"demoBanner\" hidden><strong>Ħlas demo — l-ebda ħlas.</strong> Din il-paġna għadha mhix imqabbda ma’ endpoint tal-ħlas jew tal-fulfillment. Il-buttuna hawn taħt tivvalida d-dettalji tiegħek u tgħaqqad il-payload eżatt tal-ordni, biex tkun tista’ tara preċiżament x’kellu jintbagħat.</div>\n    <div class=\"choices\" data-choice-group=\"purchaseType\" data-no-advance=\"1\">\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"subscribe\"><span class=\"price\">$39</span><span class=\"t\">Abbona &amp; iffranka</span></button>\n      <button class=\"choice\" type=\"button\" data-value=\"one_time\"><span class=\"price\">$49</span><span class=\"t\">Ta’ darba</span></button>\n    </div>\n    <form id=\"shipForm\" novalidate>\n      <div class=\"grid2\">\n        <div><label class=\"f\" for=\"firstName\">Isem</label><input type=\"text\" id=\"firstName\" autocomplete=\"given-name\"></div>\n        <div><label class=\"f\" for=\"lastName\">Kunjom</label><input type=\"text\" id=\"lastName\" autocomplete=\"family-name\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <label class=\"f\" for=\"address1\">Indirizz tat-triq</label>\n      <input type=\"text\" id=\"address1\" autocomplete=\"street-address\">\n      <label class=\"f\" for=\"address2\">Appartament, suite, eċċ. <span class=\"opt\">(mhux obbligatorju)</span></label>\n      <input type=\"text\" id=\"address2\" autocomplete=\"address-line2\">\n      <div class=\"grid2\">\n        <div><label class=\"f\" for=\"city\">Belt</label><input type=\"text\" id=\"city\" autocomplete=\"address-level2\"></div>\n        <div><label class=\"f\" for=\"stateCode\">Stat</label><input type=\"text\" id=\"stateCode\" autocomplete=\"address-level1\" placeholder=\"CA\" maxlength=\"2\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"grid2\">\n        <div><label class=\"f\" for=\"zip\">Kodiċi ZIP</label><input type=\"text\" id=\"zip\" autocomplete=\"postal-code\" inputmode=\"numeric\"></div>\n        <div><label class=\"f\" for=\"countryCode\">Pajjiż</label>\n          <select id=\"countryCode\"><option value=\"US\" selected>Stati Uniti</option><option value=\"CA\">Kanada</option><option value=\"GB\">Renju Unit</option><option value=\"AU\">Awstralja</option></select>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <label class=\"f\" for=\"phone\">Telefon <span class=\"opt\">(mhux obbligatorju, għal aġġornamenti tal-konsenja)</span></label>\n      <input type=\"tel\" id=\"phone\" autocomplete=\"tel\">\n      <div class=\"banner err\" id=\"shipErr\"></div>\n      <div style=\"height:20px\"></div>\n      <button class=\"cta\" type=\"submit\" id=\"buyBtn\">Ibda l-abbonament tiegħi — $39</button>\n      <p class=\"note\" id=\"payNote\">L-abbonament jiġġedded kull 30 jum b’$39. Waqqaf temporanjament jew ikkanċella fi kwalunkwe ħin.</p>\n    </form>\n  </section>\n\n  <!-- 13 · THANK YOU -->\n  <section class=\"screen\" data-screen=\"thanks\">\n    <img class=\"bottle\" src=\"§IMG1§\" alt=\"Flixkun tal-PDRN Brightening Serum ta’ Tava Labs\">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\">L-ordni ġiet riċevuta</p>\n    <h2>L-istandard tiegħek <em>jibda issa.</em></h2>\n    <div class=\"banner demo\" id=\"thanksDemo\" hidden><strong>Ħlas demo — ma sar l-ebda ħlas.</strong> Il-payload tal-ordni tiegħek ġie ssejvjat f’dan il-browser biex tkun tista’ tispezzjona eżattament x’se tibgħat il-verżjoni live.</div>\n    <div class=\"cardbox\" id=\"thanksBox\"></div>\n    <h2 style=\"font-size:24px;\">Ix-xiri tiegħek isegwik fl-app</h2>\n    <p class=\"lede\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\">Il-pjan tiegħek jgħix fl-app ta’ Tava, bil-marki ta’ tlestija ta’ kuljum ta’ filgħodu u filgħaxija u s-serje tiegħek u t-traċċar tal-ġarr tiegħek. L-app għadha mhix fuq l-App Store. Wara l-ħlas, il-paġna ta’ konferma u l-email tiegħek jagħtuk <strong>kodiċi tat-talba</strong>. Meta tinstalla l-app, idħol u daħħal dak il-kodiċi, u l-pjan u t-tweġibiet u l-ordni tiegħek diġà jkunu hemm. L-ebda xiri mill-ġdid.</p>\n    <!-- The app is not published yet, so there is deliberately no store\n         button here. The claim code on checkout/success.html (and in the\n         confirmation email) is the handoff. Add the real App Store link\n         next to the claim code once the app is listed. -->\n    <a class=\"cta\" href=\"/checkout/success\" id=\"appStoreBtn\">Ara l-kodiċi tat-talba tiegħi wara l-ħlas</a>\n    <p class=\"note\" id=\"carryLine\"></p>\n  </section>\n\n  <footer>Tava Labs · The Science of Attractive Health · Mistoqsijiet? talia@tavalabs.app</footer>\n</div>\n\n\n"}